{"seq":25,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"ea19a335-da24-4488-889b-5bd57069f6c6","runId":"run_1_1788374050805","result":"Done. The function uses `asyncio.Semaphore` to limit concurrency and `asyncio.gather()` to run all tasks. When you hit Ctrl+C:\n\n1. **KeyboardInterrupt** interrupts the gather call\n2. All pending tasks are automatically cancelled by asyncio\n3. Each task's **cleanup code** (try/finally blocks, context managers) runs during cancellation\n4. The interrupt propagates naturally\n\nYou can import it as `from run import run_tasks` and use it like:\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom run import run_tasks\n\nasync def my_task():\n    try:\n        await asyncio.sleep(10)\n    finally:\n        print(\"Cleanup!\")\n\nasyncio.run(run_tasks([my_task, my_task], max_concurrent=2))\n```","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":17096,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ea19a335-da24-4488-889b-5bd57069f6c6","total_cost_usd":0.018318450000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2859,"cache_read_input_tokens":26187,"output_tokens":2200,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1648},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2859},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":13498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2050,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2050,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1024,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001109,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":2200,"cacheReadInputTokens":26187,"cacheCreationInp